{"id":"5d4e38b5fc56856c","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-fraisse-characterization.md","title":"Fraïssé Theorem","display":"thm-fraisse-characterization — Fraïssé Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-fraisse-characterization","aliases":["57-thm-fraisse-characterization"],"display":"thm-fraisse-characterization — Fraïssé Theorem","depends_on":["[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]","[[57-df-first-order-language]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-finite-subset]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-fraisse-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-fraisse-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fraisse-characterization — Fraïssé Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"238427f0df2ecaed\" href=\"?note=238427f0df2ecaed\" title=\"57-df-elementary-equivalence\">57-df-elementary-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f570926126f9a186\" href=\"?note=f570926126f9a186\" title=\"57-df-finite-subset\">57-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为至多可数的纯关系语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y_1,y_2,\\ldots\">\\(x,y_1,y_2,\\ldots\\)</span> 互异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a> 的显式变量列参数接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartIso}\\)</span> 保持 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 表示有限子集。下面定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Forth}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Back}\">\\(\\mathrm{Back}\\)</span>；定理假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec b\\in|\\mathfrak M|^m\\;\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_m\\}\\}\\quad\n\\Bigl(&amp;[\\forall\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_0\\;\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec b\\in|\\mathfrak M|^m\\;\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{x,y_1,\\ldots,y_m\\}\\}\\quad\n\\Bigl(&amp;[\\forall\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma_0\\;\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]]\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists a\\in|\\mathfrak M|\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\;\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi[a,\\vec b/(x,\\vec y)]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Forth}(I)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Forth}(I)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Back}(I)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Back}(I)\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\in I\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak B)\\to\n\\left(\\mathfrak A\\equiv\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\;\n(I\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Forth}(I)\\land\\mathrm{Back}(I))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_\\omega(\\mathfrak B)\\to\n\\left(\\mathfrak A\\equiv\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartIso}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\;\n(I\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Forth}(I)\\land\\mathrm{Back}(I))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>单个永远可继续扩展的部分同构族比一般初等等价更强。这里给出其在 ω-饱和结构上的有效版本；任意结构的有限层版本仍见原 back-and-forth-equivalence 文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-